    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d301">

                <pb facs="0526" n="398" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg398"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">560.M3/55: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chief of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-07-11T14:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 11, 1928—2
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 11—11:30
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>19. Supplementary agreement signed this morning by 27 States, i. e., all those
                    represented at Conference except the United States and Bulgaria.<anchor n="38"
                        xml:id="d301-f1"/></p>
                <p>Moffat and I return to Berne this afternoon.</p>
                <p>The entire delegation expresses its thanks for helpful and sympathetic
                    support.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d301-f1" n="38" xml:id="d301-f1-content">
                <p>Signed by Mr. Wilson on behalf of the United States, July 31, 1928. For text, see
                        <ref target="#pg357">p. 357</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
